Models are not part of this repository and are not distributed with it. The converters in tools/ transform checkpoints that you obtain yourself into the engine's
formats; each model keeps its own licence, which you must comply with:
  - SmolVLM / SmolVLM2 (Hugging Face): Apache-2.0.
  - SmolVLA (Hugging Face / LeRobot): Apache-2.0.
  - Any text model you load through the LLM API (Qwen, Llama, Gemma, ...): the licence of that model.

This repository deliberately excludes the hand-pose (mesh) models WiLoR and MANO and the hand detector derived from an AGPL-licensed checkpoint: their licences restrict
redistribution and commercial use, so neither their code paths nor any converted weights are published here.
